        "original_id": "9b37b6b9-6c9f-5077-bbe9-919ac94dc3e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ozzy Osbourne, Curt Smith, Roland Orzabal\n- Organizations: Black Sabbath, Tears for Fears\n- Works: Change\n- Topics: music careers, solo albums, single releases\n\nFacts:\n- Ozzy Osbourne was born on 3 December 1948 and is an English singer, songwriter, and actor.\n- Black Sabbath fired Ozzy Osbourne in 1979.\n- Ozzy Osbourne then had a successful solo career and released 11 studio albums.\n- Ozzy Osbourne's first seven studio albums were all awarded multi-platinum certifications in the United States.\n- Change was written by Roland Orzabal and sung by Tears for Fears bassist Curt Smith.\n- Change was the fourth single released by Tears for Fears.\n- Curt Smith has released four solo albums as a solo artist.",
